      "source_quote": "How gleam thy watch-fires through the night\nwith never-fainting ray!",
      "suggested_fix": "Translate \"watch-fires\" as a form of watch/fires/beacons rather than \"vakttorn\" (watch-towers). For example: \"Hur glimma vakternas eldar genom natten\nmed ett aldrig sviktande sken!\" or \"Hur glimma dina vaktseldar genom natten\nmed en aldrig sviktande stråle!\" Preserve the two-line structure and the sense of light/beacons rather than towers.",
